  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'A POWERBOAT. A PARASAIL. SIX TONS OF TRUCK.

    A real tow cable pulls
    your airborne NWH truck through a120-second Arctic spline course. Left/right
    banks and nudges sideways. Forward/back changes wing lift for small height corrections.
    Gravity, wind, tow tension and actual contacts determine your path. You cannot
    fly freely. Your truck must fit through each ring without touching its solid
    rim.100 points, gold200, clean-center+25 and explained streak bonuses up to+40.
    Misses break your streak. One result per ring. Splashdown ends your run, keeping
    earned ring points. Highest actual score wins; exact ties share victory.

    Four
    independent simultaneous courses use the same route, physics, wind and control
    limits. Difficulty changes AI reaction and aiming precision, never launch power
    or scores. Show AI Cameras defaults OFF; AI-only retains a broadcast view. Pause/reconnect
    preserves your flight. Rematch restores every ring and tow. Offline only.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
